                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Minister Barrett to
                        the Secretary of State.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >American Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Bogotá</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1906-06-24"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">June 24,
                    1906</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Barrett reports that the President of Colombia is much pleased with
                    Secretary Root’s willingness to stop at Cartagena.)</p>
            </div>
